  "notes": "{味見|あじみ} means tasting food to check its flavor, especially while cooking. Compound of ⟦{味|あじ}→味：00826_aji⟧ (taste) + ⟦{見|み}→見る：00283_miru⟧ (checking).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{味見|あじみ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to taste X\n- {味見|あじみ}⟦して→する：00392_suru⟧みる: to try tasting\n- {味見|あじみ}⟦して→する：00392_suru⟧⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧⟦{塩|しお}→塩：00887_shio⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{足|た}す→足す：01168_tasu⟧: to taste before adding salt\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{試食|ししょく}→試食：03060_shishoku⟧: food tasting/sampling (at a store, not while cooking)\n- ⟦{試飲|しいん}→試飲：08048_shiin⟧: drink tasting/sampling\n- ⟦{味|あじ}→味：00826_aji⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧みる: to check the taste (synonym)\n{味見|あじみ} is typically done by the cook during preparation, while ⟦{試食|ししょく}→試食：03060_shishoku⟧ refers to free samples offered at shops or events.",
